ang</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Wible</surname><given-names>BA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Molecular cloning and functional expression of a novel potassium channel beta-subunit from human atrium</article-title><source>FEBS Lett</source><year>1995</year><volume>361</volume><fpage>13</fpage><lpage>16</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7890032</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Marshall</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Molloy</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Moss</surname><given-names>GWJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Howe</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Hughes</surname><given-names>TE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The Jellyfish green fluorescent protein: a new tool for studying ion channel expression and function</article-title><source>Neuron</source><year>1995</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>211</fpage><lpage>215</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7531985</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>McCormack</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>McCormack</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Tanouye</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Rudy</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>St&#x000fc;hmer</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Alternative splicing of the human <italic>Shaker</italic> K<sup>&#x0002b;</sup>channel beta 1 gene and functional expression of the beta 2 gene product</article-title><source>FEBS Lett</source><year>1995</year><volume>370</volume><fpage>32</fpage><lpage>36</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7649300</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="other">McKenna, F., M.L.J. Ashfo